WEBVTT

01:02.596 --> 01:04.221
Don't anybody move!

01:05.265 --> 01:07.349
Now, empty that safe!

01:10.854 --> 01:12.521
Money, money, money!

01:12.606 --> 01:14.898
Stop it! Stop it,
you mean, old potato!

01:14.983 --> 01:18.027
Quiet, Bo Peep,
or your sheep get run over!

01:18.194 --> 01:20.237
Help! Baa!
Help us!

01:20.322 --> 01:23.824
Oh, no, not my sheep!
Somebody do something!
